    "intro_narrative": "The rain beats against the grimy windows of the abandoned warehouse—the suspected hideout of the infamous 'Phantom' burglar. You, the lead detective of the precinct's special investigations unit, have finally tracked them here. The suspect has fled, leaving behind a chaotic mess of digital records and strange physical artifacts. Your objective is to navigate this makeshift laboratory and uncover the final piece of evidence that reveals their true identity and next target. The precinct has left you a few advanced forensic tools to aid your investigation. You must carefully analyze the encrypted digital files, trace the suspect's movements across the city grid, and piece together the fragmented clues. Time is of the essence; the Phantom's trail goes cold in a matter of hours. Use your wits to operate the terminal systems and unlock the secrets hidden within this room. The final truth awaits in the shadows.",
